{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>את כל תקף.</b> Like חוזק, and like it ואם יתקפו האחד. And behold, she wrote it, and he. The meaning of 'a second time' is on account of Mordecai's letter that he wrote first. The meaning of דברי שלום: that they not fear because they neglected the commandments of Purim. The meaning of אמת: that they are obligated to observe the Purim as they accepted upon themselves, and the witness to this interpretation is that it is אמת and the statement of Esther קיים דבר הפורים, and behold it was not confirmed through Mordecai alone until Esther wrote. The meaning of קיימו על נפשם ועל זרעם דברי הצומות — according to the opinion of the many — is regarding the fast of Esther; and those who deny it said that the verse speaks of the three days they fasted in Nisan, and all Israel are fit to fast thus always. And in my opinion our sages of blessed memory fixed the fast on the day of fear. The meaning of דברי הצומות: regarding those mentioned in the book of Zechariah, which are in Tammuz, Av, Tishrei, and Tevet. The reason: because the Jews established upon themselves to rejoice on the days of Purim just as they established upon themselves and upon their seed to fast on the days of their mourning, when the city was breached and the House was burned — for the prophet did not command them to fast, as I shall explain in its place — and we are obligated not to overstep the boundary of the earlier ones. The meaning of וזעקתם: to pray and to cry out to HaShem on the days of the fast. And the word אלה returns to דברי, not to the Purim."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The phrase 'ואנחנו חייבים שלא נשיג גבול ראשונים' is rendered hyper-literally; it appears within a long syntactic chain and its exact syntactic relationship to the preceding clause about Zechariah's fasts is ambiguous in the Hebrew."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:31.854076813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}